    "titling reaches neighborhoods in batches, when the Instituto de la Propiedad (IP) runs a program",
    "without full title (*dominio pleno*) a house cannot back a bank loan or a mortgage, so it is not insured either (Barriers 3 and 9)",
    "for the road north, a passport needs a DNI and US$35–50, and a U.S. visitor visa costs US$185 just to apply, with approval resting on proof of income and ties the family does not have",
    "the legal road is closed in practice, so people take the other one (Barrier 7)",
    "returnees land in SPS needing a police record to apply for work"
